## 7. Acceptance checks

<!-- Grep-verifiable + structural. Every check must be runnable verbatim by the reviewer.
     Biological checks are logged, not stop()-ped. -->

**Structural (the script RUNS and produces its declared artifacts):**
```bash
# All declared output files exist:
ls 03_results/<stage_id>/figures/_overview/<stem>.print.pdf
ls 03_results/<stage_id>/figures/_overview/<stem>.screen.png
ls 03_results/<stage_id>/tables/_overview/<stem>.csv

# Test suite green:
bash tests/run-all.sh | tail -3  # expect "failed: 0"
```

**Compute→viz discipline:**
```bash
# No plotting calls in compute scripts:
grep -n "ggsave\|save_figure\|savefig\|plt\.show" 02_analysis/scripts/<NN_compute_script.R> && echo "VIOLATION" || echo "clean"

# No model re-runs in viz scripts:
grep -n "lmFit\|voomLmFit\|eBayes\|fgsea\|DESeq2" 02_analysis/scripts/<NN_viz_script.R> && echo "VIOLATION" || echo "clean"
```

**Figure-style compliance:**
```bash
# No inline theme() calls in viz scripts:
grep -n "theme(text" 02_analysis/scripts/<NN_viz_script.R> && echo "VIOLATION" || echo "clean"

# No hardcoded ggsave dimensions:
grep -n "ggsave(width=[0-9]" 02_analysis/scripts/<NN_viz_script.R> && echo "VIOLATION" || echo "clean"

# project_theme() / set_paper_style() is sourced:
grep -n "project_theme\|set_paper_style" 02_analysis/scripts/<NN_viz_script.R> || echo "MISSING"
```

**Results placement:**
```bash
# Stage declared in config before first write:
grep "<stage_id>" 02_analysis/config/analysis_config.yaml || echo "STAGE MISSING from config"

# Artifacts in canonical subdirs:
ls 03_results/<stage_id>/figures/
ls 03_results/<stage_id>/tables/
```

**Caption completeness:**
```bash
# README caption exists for each figure:
grep "## figures/_overview/<stem>" 03_results/<stage_id>/README.md || echo "CAPTION MISSING"
```

